{
  "$jdf": "1.0.0",
  "meta": { "title": "Why we built JDF", "author": "Ugur Kazdal", "pageSize": "A4", "unit": "mm" },
  "styles": {
    "h1": { "fontFamily": "Inter", "fontSize": 30, "fontWeight": "bold", "color": "#0f172a", "lineHeight": 1.1 },
    "h2": { "fontFamily": "Inter", "fontSize": 16, "fontWeight": "bold", "color": "#1e293b", "marginTop": 8 },
    "lead": { "fontFamily": "Inter", "fontSize": 14, "color": "#475569", "lineHeight": 1.6, "fontStyle": "italic" },
    "body": { "fontFamily": "Inter", "fontSize": 11, "lineHeight": 1.7, "color": "#334155" },
    "code": { "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono", "fontSize": 9.5, "color": "#1e293b", "backgroundColor": "#f1f5f9", "padding": 12, "borderRadius": 6, "lineHeight": 1.5 },
    "byline": { "fontFamily": "Inter", "fontSize": 9, "color": "#94a3b8", "letterSpacing": 1 }
  },
  "footer": { "content": "{{title}}  ·  page {{pageNumber}} of {{totalPages}}", "style": { "fontFamily": "Inter", "fontSize": 9, "color": "#94a3b8" } },
  "pages": [
    {
      "id": "page-1",
      "elements": [
        { "type": "text", "content": "OPINION  ·  2026", "style": "byline", "position": { "x": 0, "y": 4 }, "width": 166 },
        { "type": "text", "content": "Why we built JDF", "heading": 1, "style": "h1", "tocEntry": "Why we built JDF", "position": { "x": 0, "y": 12 }, "width": 166 },
        { "type": "text", "content": "PDF was designed in 1993 for laser printers. The web has since rewritten every other format on the planet — except documents.", "style": "lead", "position": { "x": 0, "y": 38 }, "width": 166 },
        { "type": "shape", "shape": "rect", "fill": "#2563eb", "position": { "x": 0, "y": 60 }, "width": 16, "height": 0.5 },

        { "type": "text", "content": "The problem", "heading": 2, "tocEntry": "The problem", "tocLevel": 2, "style": "h2", "position": { "x": 0, "y": 70 }, "width": 166 },
        { "type": "text", "content": "Every fix-a-typo task currently requires Adobe Acrobat ($240/year), a Word roundtrip, or some janky online converter. Every git diff on a PDF is meaningless. Every script that generates one needs a 200KB library to encode fonts as Type 1 dictionaries.", "style": "body", "position": { "x": 0, "y": 86 }, "width": 166 },

        { "type": "text", "content": "The premise", "heading": 2, "tocEntry": "The premise", "tocLevel": 2, "style": "h2", "position": { "x": 0, "y": 130 }, "width": 166 },
        { "type": "text", "content": "What if a document was just JSON? Open it in any text editor — clean source. Open it in a viewer — a rendered page. Edit either side, the other follows. cat, grep, jq, VS Code, every diff tool already understands JSON. There's nothing left to invent.", "style": "body", "position": { "x": 0, "y": 146 }, "width": 166 },

        { "type": "text", "content": "{\n  \"$jdf\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"meta\": { \"title\": \"Hello\" },\n  \"pages\": [{ \"elements\": [\n    { \"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"Hi\", \"heading\": 1 }\n  ]}]\n}", "style": "code", "position": { "x": 0, "y": 195 }, "width": 166 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-2",
      "elements": [
        { "type": "text", "content": "OPINION  ·  2026", "style": "byline", "position": { "x": 0, "y": 4 }, "width": 166 },

        { "type": "text", "content": "What you get", "heading": 2, "tocEntry": "What you get", "tocLevel": 2, "style": "h2", "position": { "x": 0, "y": 12 }, "width": 166 },
        { "type": "list", "listType": "unordered", "position": { "x": 0, "y": 28 }, "width": 166, "style": "body",
          "items": [
            { "content": "A native macOS desktop reader (10 MB) that reads, renders, edits, and auto-saves." },
            { "content": "A 25 KB JavaScript library (jdfjs) that drops a viewer onto any web page with one tag." },
            { "content": "A CLI that validates against the JSON Schema and converts Markdown into JDF." },
            { "content": "A format that survives — JSON has no vendor, no proprietary parser." }
          ]
        },

        { "type": "text", "content": "Embedding on the web", "heading": 2, "tocEntry": "Embedding", "tocLevel": 2, "style": "h2", "position": { "x": 0, "y": 80 }, "width": 166 },
        { "type": "text", "content": "Three lines and a tag — your document appears on the page, fully styled, scrollable, with a clickable TOC.", "style": "body", "position": { "x": 0, "y": 96 }, "width": 166 },

        { "type": "text", "content": "<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://unpkg.com/jdfjs/dist/jdfjs.css\">\n<script type=\"module\" src=\"https://unpkg.com/jdfjs\"></script>\n<jdf src=\"/whitepaper.jdf\"></jdf>", "style": "code", "position": { "x": 0, "y": 116 }, "width": 166 },

        { "type": "text", "content": "What's next", "heading": 2, "tocEntry": "What's next", "tocLevel": 2, "style": "h2", "position": { "x": 0, "y": 165 }, "width": 166 },
        { "type": "text", "content": "Editor plugins. Real-time collaboration over CRDTs. A rich-text inspector. A Figma-to-JDF converter. The format is small enough that the surface area of useful tooling is enormous — and JSON means the tooling already half-exists.", "style": "body", "position": { "x": 0, "y": 181 }, "width": 166 }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
